# Force LF line endings for every file in this snapshot, on every platform.
#
# These files are a verbatim third-party snapshot; their SHA-256 hashes
# are recorded in `_manifest.json` and `ATTRIBUTION.md`. Any CRLF
# conversion (e.g. via core.autocrlf=true on Windows) would invalidate
# those hashes on checkout. Treating them as `text eol=lf` keeps the
# working tree, the repository, and the manifest in sync on all OSes.
*           text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.ts        text eol=lf
LICENSE     text eol=lf
